  "status": "PROPOSED default display palette (named default `palette:llull-ral-approx-v1`). NOT a standard value and NEVER a pass/fail gate: no RAL / BS 4800 / ANSI Z535.1 colour has an official sRGB value, several safety colours lie outside sRGB (forum report S14), and the one machine-readable RAL table found (npm ral-colors 1.0.1, MIT, S13) is internally inconsistent: its HEX and rgb fields differ for 14 of the 15 codes below (only RAL 1021 agrees) (e.g. RAL 2003 HEX #FA842B vs rgb 241,120,41). Grade C.",
